  "translation": "Nguva iyoyo vanyori vamambo vakadanwa, mumwedzi wechitatu — ndiro mwedzi rweSiwani — pa makumi maviri nematatu aro; zvakanyorwa sezvose izvo Murodekai akarayira, kune vaJudha, nokune madzinduna, namagavana, novatungamiri ematunhu ano kubva paHodhu kusvika kuKushi — matunhu zana rimwe namakumi maviri nomwe — dunhu nedunhu sokunyoro kwawo, vanhu navanhu serurimi rwavo, nokune vaJudha sokunyoro kwavo neserurimi rwavo.",
